# Catalogue signing private key. It belongs in a GitHub Actions secret and an offline backup,
# never in the repository. Named defensively because losing control of it means every installed
# app has to be updated (SECURITY.md, key rotation).
*.key
prana-catalogue-signing.*
!keys/catalogue-signing.pub
